{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"余等化子"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"余等化子"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>态射 $f,g\\colon X\\to Y$ 的余等化子 $\\operatorname{coeq}(f,g)$ 等同于如下推出:\n$$\r\nY\\sqcup_{X\\sqcup X}Y,\r\n$$\n其中两个映射分别为 $\\mathrm{id}\\sqcup\\mathrm{id}$ 与 $f\\sqcup g$.</p>\n"}}